livant's $390,000, and no independent polling shows a competitive contest. Analysts across the spectrum rate the race between Likely Democratic and Safe Democratic, and prediction markets put his chances near 95 percent.\n\nThe campaign has centered on affordability, data-center growth, and jobs, with Governor Spanberger joining Vindman to energize canvassers in the race's final stretch. Ollivant, a first-time candidate, has struggled to fund a serious challenge, and the independent and Libertarian nominees trail far behind in resources. The district's modest Democratic lean, combined with a favorable national environment, points to a comfortable but not entirely risk-free incumbent win.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.972, "margin": 13.04}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9562, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9664, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9683, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9585, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9406, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9612, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9637, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9667, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9827, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9791, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9746, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9559, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9685, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9681, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9696, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9686, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9744, "margin": 13.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9771, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9687, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9709, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9722, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9